        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.pickfordmuseum.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2012 the society’s historic building was added to the National Register of Historic Places.",
