      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pickford_Township%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Munuscong River winds through the township, passing the communities of Pickford, Stirlingville, and Kelden.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
